nvmix-fortran
==============

This project is a modern Fortran translation of numerical algorithms from
nvmix 0.1-2.

Original package:
  Copyright (C) 2018 Marius Hofert, Erik Hintz and Christiane Lemieux
  License: GNU General Public License version 3 or later

The original source supplied by the user is retained unmodified under
original/nvmix-0.1-2 and provenance/nvmix-master.zip.

The translation preserves GPL-3.0-or-later licensing. Plotting, R S3 methods,
R package registration, R data serialization and third-party adapter code are
not compiled into the Fortran library.
